{"seq":3,"slug":"gsap-essentials","title":"GSAP 核心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/animation/gsap-essentials","wordCount":510,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"gsap-核心\">GSAP 核心</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>GSAP（GreenSock Animation Platform）是 Web 上最强大的 JavaScript 动画库。当 CSS 动画无法满足需求时——复杂的时间轴编排、滚动驱动动画、精确的进度控制——GSAP 是首选方案。它的性能经过极致优化，API 简洁一致，在 2000 万+ 网站上运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GSAP 以 <strong>Tween</strong>（补间，描述&quot;什么从哪到哪&quot;）为最小单位，把多个 Tween 组合进 <strong>Timeline</strong>（时间轴）以精确控制顺序、嵌套与进度，再用 <strong>ScrollTrigger</strong> 等插件把时间轴绑到滚动、拖拽等外部驱动上，从而突破 CSS 动画在编排与进度控制上的边界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;GSAP 核心&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Tween - 单个动画&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Timeline - 时间轴编排&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;ScrollTrigger - 滚动驱动&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;插件生态&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Draggable&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;MotionPath&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;SplitText&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"GSAP 核心\"] --&gt; B[\"Tween - 单个动画\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Timeline - 时间轴编排\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"ScrollTrigger - 滚动驱动\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"插件生态\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Draggable\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"MotionPath\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"SplitText\"]</pre><h2 id=\"tween-基础\">Tween 基础</h2><p>Tween 是 GSAP 的基本动画单元，控制一个或多个属性从一个值变到另一个值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import gsap from &#39;gsap&#39;;&#10;&#10;gsap.to(&#39;.box&#39;, {&#10;  x: 200,&#10;  rotation: 360,&#10;  duration: 1,&#10;  ease: &#39;power2.out&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;gsap.from(&#39;.title&#39;, {&#10;  opacity: 0,&#10;  y: 50,&#10;  duration: 0.8,&#10;});&#10;&#10;gsap.fromTo(&#39;.element&#39;, { opacity: 0, scale: 0.5 }, { opacity: 1, scale: 1, duration: 0.6 });&#10;&#10;gsap.set(&#39;.hidden&#39;, { opacity: 0, y: 20 });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gsap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gsap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.box'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rotation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">360</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'power2.out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fromTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.element'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scale: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scale: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.hidden'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>gsap.to()</code></td>\n<td>从当前状态动画到目标状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gsap.from()</code></td>\n<td>从指定状态动画到当前状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gsap.fromTo()</code></td>\n<td>指定起始和结束状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gsap.set()</code></td>\n<td>立即设置属性（无动画）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"常用属性映射\">常用属性映射</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"gsap.to(&#39;.box&#39;, {&#10;  x: 100, // transform: translateX(100px)&#10;  y: -50, // transform: translateY(-50px)&#10;  rotation: 45, // transform: rotate(45deg)&#10;  scale: 1.2, // transform: scale(1.2)&#10;  scaleX: 2, // transform: scaleX(2)&#10;  opacity: 0.5,&#10;  borderRadius: &#39;50%&#39;,&#10;  backgroundColor: &#39;#3b82f6&#39;,&#10;  duration: 1,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.box'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// transform: translateX(100px)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  y: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// transform: translateY(-50px)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rotation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// transform: rotate(45deg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scale: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// transform: scale(1.2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scaleX: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// transform: scaleX(2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  borderRadius: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'50%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  backgroundColor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#3b82f6'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓动函数\">缓动函数</h2><p>GSAP 内置了丰富的缓动函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"gsap.to(&#39;.a&#39;, { x: 200, ease: &#39;none&#39; });&#10;gsap.to(&#39;.b&#39;, { x: 200, ease: &#39;power1.out&#39; });&#10;gsap.to(&#39;.c&#39;, { x: 200, ease: &#39;power2.inOut&#39; });&#10;gsap.to(&#39;.d&#39;, { x: 200, ease: &#39;back.out(1.7)&#39; });&#10;gsap.to(&#39;.e&#39;, { x: 200, ease: &#39;elastic.out(1, 0.3)&#39; });&#10;gsap.to(&#39;.f&#39;, { x: 200, ease: &#39;bounce.out&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.b'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'power1.out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.c'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'power2.inOut'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'back.out(1.7)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.e'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'elastic.out(1, 0.3)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.f'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bounce.out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓动</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>power1-4.out</code></td>\n<td>由快到慢（数字越大越急）</td>\n<td>UI 进入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>power1-4.in</code></td>\n<td>由慢到快</td>\n<td>UI 退出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>back.out</code></td>\n<td>超出后回弹</td>\n<td>弹性进入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>elastic.out</code></td>\n<td>弹簧效果</td>\n<td>强调动画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bounce.out</code></td>\n<td>弹跳</td>\n<td>落地效果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"timeline-时间轴\">Timeline 时间轴</h2><p>Timeline 是 GSAP 最强大的功能——将多个 Tween 编排为有序的动画序列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { duration: 0.5, ease: &#39;power2.out&#39; } });&#10;&#10;tl.from(&#39;.hero-title&#39;, { opacity: 0, y: 50 })&#10;  .from(&#39;.hero-subtitle&#39;, { opacity: 0, y: 30 }, &#39;-=0.3&#39;)&#10;  .from(&#39;.hero-button&#39;, { opacity: 0, scale: 0.8 }, &#39;-=0.2&#39;)&#10;  .from(&#39;.hero-image&#39;, { opacity: 0, x: 100 }, &#39;-=0.4&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ defaults: { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'power2.out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.hero-title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.hero-subtitle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-=0.3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;-