an><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">restart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tween.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tween.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeScale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tween.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Tween</strong> 是基本动画单元：<code>to()</code>、<code>from()</code>、<code>fromTo()</code>、<code>set()</code></li>\n<li><strong>缓动函数</strong>丰富（power、back、elastic、bounce），<code>power2.out</code> 是通用选择</li>\n<li><strong>Timeline</strong> 将多个 Tween 编排为序列，位置参数（<code>-=</code>、<code>&lt;</code>、绝对时间）控制时序</li>\n<li><strong>Stagger</strong> 一行代码实现交错动画，支持网格布局和自定义起始点</li>\n<li><strong>ScrollTrigger</strong> 是滚动驱动动画的标准方案，支持 scrub、pin、toggleActions</li>\n<li>GSAP 的 <code>kill()</code> 方法可以清理动画实例，避免内存泄漏</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GSAP 核心","id":"gsap-核心"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Tween 基础","id":"tween-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"常用属性映射","id":"常用属性映射"},{"level":2,"text":"缓动函数","id":"缓动函数"},{"level":2,"text":"Timeline 时间轴","id":"timeline-时间轴"},{"level":3,"text":"位置参数","id":"位置参数"},{"level":2,"text":"Stagger 交错","id":"stagger-交错"}